{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chess, but without the bureaucratic back-and-forth of <i>actually taking your turns</i>. There's no time to waste in this hectic re-imagining of your favorite checkered strategy game. Blink once, and it's Checkmate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you move a piece, you lose some mana- But every second, you gain some mana. Save it up to launch a 4-pronged assault, or move one piece at a time to keep your enemy on their toes! Both players move simultaneously, so quick-witted maneuvers are just as important as long-term strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single match can last anywhere between 10 seconds and 10 minutes. Hyper Chess features over a dozen unique Chess Sets to collect, several unique game modes to spice up the fun, and local/online multiplayer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830210?t=1753828431","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830210?t=1753828431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/632694566b4e31c3bcb162609ce188fd99f1287a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753828431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/632694566b4e31c3bcb162609ce188fd99f1287a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753828431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chess, but without the bureaucratic back-and-forth of <i>actually taking your turns</i>. There's no time to waste in this hectic re-imagining of your favorite checkered strategy game. Blink once, and it's Checkmate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you move a piece, you lose some mana- But every second, you gain some mana. Save it up to launch a 4-pronged assault, or move one piece at a time to keep your enemy on their toes! Both players move simultaneously, so quick-witted maneuvers are just as important as long-term strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single match can last anywhere between 10 seconds and 10 minutes. Hyper Chess features over a dozen unique Chess Sets to collect, several unique game modes to spice up the fun, and local/online multiplayer.</p>","developers":["Grouch","SuitNtie"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/4ad978030c963ce9d64f03d65857e02bbc1eefd8/header.jpg?t=1753828431","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175495,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175495/movie480.mp4?t=1753828429","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175495/movie_max.mp4?t=1753828429"},"name":"Hyper Chess Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175495/9dd2f2292f205ac48331b4db6c7fa1a593dd08c4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753828429","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175495/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753828429","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175495/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753828429"}}],"name":"Hyper Chess","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graph